+
+// EXL3_GR_STATE_IN_UP variant: the up launch derives the state row from `dots`
+// inside each CTA, so no separate state/state_regrid launch runs. dots, state,
+// post and mixed contents are bitwise-identical to gr_mix_v2_int8_regrid's.
+void gr_mix_v2_int8_statein
+(
